---
status: 'published';
// Perform booking page for Synchronize Coffee
import SyncCoffeeLayout from '@/layouts/SyncCoffeeLayout.astro';
---

<SyncCoffeeLayout
  title="Book a Performance - Synchronize Coffee"
  description="Request a small performance, reading, or community event at Synchronize Coffee."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="relative bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-24"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img
        src="/images/coffee/beautiful_wood_table.webp"
        alt=""
        role="presentation"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25 dark:opacity-35"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/75 via-white/45 to-white/15 dark:from-blue-950/70 dark:via-blue-950/50 dark:to-gray-950/65"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"
    >
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-6"
      >
        Book a Performance
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed"
      >
        Bring a song, a poem, a story, or an idea into the room.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Performances Belong Here -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p
        class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 mb-4"
      >
        Shared attention
      </p>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-6"
      >
        A room changes when someone steps forward to share.
      </h2>

      <div
        class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
      >
        <p>
          Synchronize is built for everyday coffee, but it also makes room for
          small moments of performance: a songwriter testing new material, a
          poet reading to a quiet room, a storyteller gathering neighbors around
          a shared experience.
        </p>

        <p>
          We are interested in intimate, human-scale events that fit the feeling
          of a café and give people a reason to listen together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Works Here -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-blue-950/40">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
        >
          What Works in the Space
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          The best fit is usually simple, warm, and close to the room.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 text-center shadow-sm"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-3"
          >
            Music
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Acoustic sets, singer-songwriters, small ensembles, and music that
            can meet the room without overpowering it.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 text-center shadow-sm"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-3"
          >
            Words
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Poetry, storytelling, readings, short talks, and thoughtful programs
            that invite people to listen together.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 text-center shadow-sm"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-3"
          >
            Community Moments
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Small gatherings, creative showcases, conversations, and events that
            help the café feel connected to the neighborhood.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stage info -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div
      class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center"
    >
      <div>
        <p
          class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 mb-4"
        >
          Human-scale events
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
        >
          A small setup for close attention.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We can support compact performances with basic sound needs. The goal
            is not volume; it is presence.
          </p>

          <p>
            Typical sets are 30–60 minutes. We can usually provide a compact PA,
            microphones, a direct input, basic cables, and access to power.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 md:p-8"
      >
        <h3
          class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-5"
        >
          Good fits include
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>• Acoustic music and small sets</li>
          <li>• Poetry, readings, and storytelling</li>
          <li>• Short talks or discussion-based events</li>
          <li>• Creative showcases and community programs</li>
          <li>• Intimate events that work well in a café setting</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Booking form -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950" id="booking">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-8 text-center">
        <p
          class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 mb-4"
        >
          Request a date
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
        >
          Tell us what you'd like to share.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Share the basics about your act, idea, or event. This demo form routes
          to a confirmation page, but no real booking is made.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-4 rounded-r-md mb-6"
      >
        <p class="text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm">
          <strong>Concept Demo:</strong> This is a concept site for demonstration.
          No real booking will be made.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form
        action="/concept/sync-coffee/perform/confirmed/"
        method="get"
        class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5"
      >
        <!-- Performer / contact -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="actName"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Performer / Act Name</label
            >
            <input
              id="actName"
              name="actName"
              type="text"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="contactName"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Contact Name</label
            >
            <input
              id="contactName"
              name="contactName"
              type="text"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="email"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Email</label
            >
            <input
              id="email"
              name="email"
              type="email"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="phone"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Phone <span class="text-gray-500">(optional)</span></label
            >
            <input
              id="phone"
              name="phone"
              type="tel"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Basics -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="date"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Preferred Date</label
            >
            <input
              id="date"
              name="date"
              type="date"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="time"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Start Time</label
            >
            <input
              id="time"
              name="time"
              type="time"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="length"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Set Length</label
            >
            <select
              id="length"
              name="length"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            >
              <option>30 minutes</option>
              <option>45 minutes</option>
              <option>60 minutes</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Act details -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="type"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Format</label
            >
            <select
              id="type"
              name="type"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            >
              <option>Music</option>
              <option>Poetry / Reading</option>
              <option>Storytelling</option>
              <option>Short Talk / Conversation</option>
              <option>Community Program</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="size"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Performers / Presenters</label
            >
            <input
              id="size"
              name="size"
              type="number"
              min="1"
              value="1"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Equipment & links -->
        <fieldset
          class="border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 rounded-md p-4"
        >
          <legend
            class="px-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200"
          >
            Equipment Needed
          </legend>
          <div
            class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mt-3 text-sm text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200"
          >
            <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              <input
                type="checkbox"
                name="gear"
                value="PA"
                class="accent-blue-700"
              />
              PA
            </label>
            <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              <input
                type="checkbox"
                name="gear"
                value="Mic"
                class="accent-blue-700"
              />
              Mic
            </label>
            <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              <input
                type="checkbox"
                name="gear"
                value="DI"
                class="accent-blue-700"
              />
              DI
            </label>
            <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              <input
                type="checkbox"
                name="gear"
                value="Power"
                class="accent-blue-700"
              />
              Power
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="links"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Sample Link</label
            >
            <input
              id="links"
              name="links"
              type="url"
              placeholder="Website, video, or audio"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label
              for="social"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Social Handle</label
            >
            <input
              id="social"
              name="social"
              type="text"
              placeholder="@yourhandle"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label
            for="description"
            class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
            >What would you like to share?</label
          >
          <textarea
            id="description"
            name="description"
            rows="5"
            class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            placeholder="Tell us about the performance, reading, conversation, or event."
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label
              for="comp"
              class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-1"
              >Compensation Preference</label
            >
            <select
              id="comp"
              name="comp"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-3 py-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
            >
              <option>Tip Jar</option>
              <option>Guarantee</option>
              <option>Merch Table</option>
              <option>Open to discuss</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-6">
            <input
              id="agree"
              name="agree"
              type="checkbox"
              required
              class="accent-blue-700"
            />
            <label for="agree" class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              I understand this is a concept form and agree to follow venue
              volume and space guidelines.
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4"
        >
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            In a real café, we would review and reply within one business day.
          </p>
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="bg-orange-600 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-md font-semibold hover:bg-orange-700 transition dark:bg-orange-500 dark:hover:bg-orange-400"
          >
            Submit Request
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-blue-950/40">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4"
      >
        Planning something larger?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
        If your idea is more of a gathering than a performance, reserve a space
        or send us a note.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/concept/sync-coffee/reserve/"
          class="inline-block bg-orange-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-orange-700 transition dark:bg-orange-500 dark:hover:bg-orange-400"
          >Reserve a Space</a
        >
        <a
          href="/concept/sync-coffee/contact/"
          class="inline-block border border-blue-700 text-blue-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-50 transition dark:border-blue-300 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/30"
          >Contact Us</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SyncCoffeeLayout>
